+ *
+ * Based on:
+ *
+ * Device Tree file for Thecus N2350 board
+ *    Copyright (C) 2018-2023 Tony Dinh <mibodhi@gmail.com>
+ *    Copyright (C) 2018 Manuel Jung <manuel.jung@hotmail.com>
+ * Device Tree file for Synology DS116 NAS
