+/*
+ * The DS216 mainboard exposes a footprint for a full-size SD
+ * card socket. If you successfully soldered one, you can try to
+ * enable it's interface by uncommenting the following untested code.
+ * Even though most required components seems in place, some may be
+ * missing for the interface to function properly.
+ * Please leave feedback at forum.doozan.com.
